      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Fedya finishes his story, pastry chef Louis chimes in with the time he nearly got fired for teasing Chef Barinov on a rough morning. Walking in while the Chef was nursing a brutal hangover, Louis cheerfully joked that alcohol had skipped Barinov's liver and gone straight for his brain.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да ладно, не бери в голову.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Тебе тогда же лучше.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Всё, увольняюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Так, шеф!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Доброе утро!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Доброе утро, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Так, я приветствую.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Работников, ножа, топора.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Весело у вас тут, а?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ну как, а?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
